<h2><a name=3D"_7nzwkb2y3y6e"></a><span lang=3DEN>Fear</span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>When encountering something frightenin=
g, you
must pass a Fear test to avoid being Terrified. This is not an action. Roll=
 for
Logic or Empathy (the attribute only) and you get +1 die for each other pla=
yer
character present in the scene, up to a maximum of +3 dice.</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>If you fail, you suffer a number of me=
ntal
Conditions equal to the Fear value minus the number of successes you did ro=
ll
and you become Terrified.</span></p>

