<h3><a name=3D"_pp9flctrdpzv"></a><span lang=3DEN>WELLSPRING STREET 59 </sp=
an></h3>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>There are plenty of brothels in Upsala=
, the
most famous being Wellspring Street 59 run by Madam Tekla. Said to be a
crofter&#8217;s daughter from the small town of V&auml;nge, Tekla is now a
wealthy woman, well-connected with both the university and elite members of=
 the
clergy. Her employees are treated very badly. Many have contracted syphilis=
 and
pneumonia, and most have given birth to children who died or were taken awa=
y.
Beatings are common, as are various forms of drug use. People who make thei=
r living
selling sex are registered in the prostitution ledger, forced to undergo
regular medical examinations, and can never again hold a normal job.</span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN style=3D'mso-no-proof:yes'><!--[if gte=
