<div class=3DWordSection8>

<h1><a name=3D"_8eh0hyk9wqua"></a><span lang=3DEN>THE HISTORY OF THE SOCIET=
Y </span></h1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Linnea Elfeklint can tell you a lot ab=
out the
founding of the Society and what happened afterwards. She is renting a room=
 in
a simple apartment in central Upsala, but spends most of her time at the
city&#8217;s mental asylum.</span></p>

<h1><a name=3D"_3jxglnaid2s6"></a><span lang=3DEN>THE SOCIETY IS REBORN </s=
pan></h1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>You and the other player characters ha=
ve for
different reasons decided to track down and fight vaesen, or help resolve
conflicts between humans and vaesen.</span></p>

<h1><a name=3D"_3x788ghpa8j6"></a><span lang=3DEN>CAMPAIGN RULES </span></h=
1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Every time the player characters retur=
n to
headquarters you must determine whether any Insights and Afflictions obtain=
ed
become permanent or wear off. Furthermore, the player characters may expand=
 and
upgrade their headquarters. But there is also a risk of threats arising in
Upsala &#8211; vaesen who for whatever reason are after the player characte=
rs
or their headquarters, or ordinary humans such as police officers or
journalists looking to cause trouble. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_l4z1yt2onxer"></a><span lang=3DEN>YOUR HEADQUARTERS </span>=
</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>After solving mysteries you will have =
an
opportunity to improve your headquarters. You can hire staff, explore unkno=
wn
parts of the HQ, add new facilities or renovate existing ones. Once you ret=
urn
to Upsala after a mystery, you must together answer questions about what you
have experienced &#8211; each affirmative answer yields one Development Poi=
nt.
Before taking on a new mystery you can use your Development Points to purch=
ase
Upgrades for your headquarters. Unspent Development Points are saved. Every
time you purchase an Upgrade there is a risk that a threat will arise. At t=
he
start of the game you already have two Upgrades: Library and Butler Algot
Frisk.</span><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shape id=3D"image33.png" o:spid=3D"_x000=
0_s1028"
