<h2><a name=3D"_n20toicvojas"></a><span lang=3DEN>RECOVERY &#8211; AFFLICTI=
ONS AND
INSIGHTS </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>After completing a mystery each player
character must determine whether the Afflictions and Insights you have gain=
ed
become permanent or wear off. This is done with a dice roll. On a failure y=
our
Afflictions become permanent and your Insights wear off before the next
mystery. The roll cannot be pushed. Insights and Afflictions that become
permanent can never be removed. </span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>If you have gained both physical and m=
ental
Insights or Afflictions, you make a physical recovery roll and a mental
recovery roll. </span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>The number of dice used for the physic=
al
recovery roll is determined by adding the values of your Physique and Preci=
sion
together &#8211; for example, if you have Physique 3 and Precision 2, you
should roll 5 dice. For each success you may either heal an Affliction or m=
ake
an Insight permanent. </span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>For mental Afflictions and Insights yo=
u roll a
number of dice equal to your combined Logic and Empathy. Each success heals=
 an
Affliction or causes an Insight to become permanent. </span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>By purchasing Upgrades to the Society&=
#8217;s
headquarters, you can get a chance to push your recovery rolls or gain
additional dice on your rolls.</span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_ftobd49v3t9m"></a><span lang=3DEN>GEAR IN THE HEADQUARTERS =
</span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Besides your personal items, gear acqu=
ired
during a mystery is assumed to be sold or lost once the mystery is conclude=
d.
Months can pass before the next mystery takes place, and once it does, it is
time to acquire new equipment. Therefore, every player character only gets =
to
keep their personal gear on the character sheet. The headquarters will, onc=
e it
is expanded with Upgrades, gain the ability to store some temporary gear, b=
ut
also to reward the player characters with free items to bring on their expe=
ditions
without spending Resources. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_vq24ts7mb8sc"></a><span lang=3DEN>UPGRADES</span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>There are three types of Upgrades: Fac=
ilities,
Contacts, and Personnel. Facilities are new rooms or functions you discover=
 or
construct at headquarters. Contacts are people who can help you, and Person=
nel
are servants or new members of the Society. </span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>All Upgrades consist of several catego=
ries:
Prerequisite, Cost, Function, and Asset. Prerequisites are things you need
before the Upgrade can be purchased &#8211; Resources means that the player
characters (their Resources ratings added up) must have at least the specif=
ied
value. Development Points is the number of such points to be spent to purch=
ase
the Upgrade. Function and Asset explain the purpose of the Upgrade and what
effects it provides. </span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Each Upgrade can use its Function and =
its
Asset once per mystery. The only exceptions are the Infirmary, Chapel, and
Treasure Chamber, which can be used once by each player character &#8211; f=
or
example, everyone in the group may push their recovery rolls. Some Upgrades=
 can
be purchased multiple times, which allows them to be used more than once. <=
/span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>The gaming group is free to come up wi=
th other
Upgrades in addition to the ones below.</span></p>

