FORCE </b>when
parrying. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_3z8fhfejfsnk"></a><span lang=3DEN>CONTACTS </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Once per session you can decide that y=
ou
already know a certain NPC, and that your relationship is a positive one. T=
he
Gamemaster may disallow it, if the contact would make the mystery less fun.=
 </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_py8ebgm77gi4"></a><span lang=3DEN>COWARD </span></h2>

