nother
player character take damage in your stead by passing a <b>STEALTH </b>test=
. It
does not count as an action. If the test fails, you are hit for 1 extra dam=
age.
This can be done once per combat encounter.</span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_okn073ua66i5"></a><span lang=3DEN>DECEPTIVE </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Gain +2 to <b>MANIPULATION </b>when ch=
eating
and deceiving. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_1aw2u274f47j"></a><span lang=3DEN>DEDICATED </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Once per session you can ignore a ment=
al
Condition from pushing a skill test. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_rzm3cw44v55e"></a><span lang=3DEN>DEFENSIVE</span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Each round you get one extra fast acti=
on that
may only be used to dodge or parry. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_8xqnxb5hqlx4"></a><span lang=3DEN>DUAL WEAPONS </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>When using dual weapons in close comba=
t, you
