you to
use <b>INSPIRATION </b>to attack vaesen in close combat, dealing 1 damage.<=
/span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_mvcw908dd48a"></a><span lang=3DEN>LIGHTNING REFLEXES </span=
></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>You can draw weapons without using an =
action. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_wz632hllftrb"></a><span lang=3DEN>NINE LIVES </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>When rolling for a critical injury, yo=
u may
decide which of the dice represents the tens and which represents the ones.=
 </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_ftqpcu5q32af"></a><span lang=3DEN>PET </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>You have a pet that you can use once p=
er
session to gain +1 to a test of your choice in a situation where your pet is
