med. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_xkkkpfi9duha"></a><span lang=3DEN>SAFETY IN NUMBERS </span>=
</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Gain +2 to Fear tests when accompanied=
 by at
least two other player characters. In combat this only applies if you are in
