to
outrun or chase down someone. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_7dj08x2pvph3"></a><span lang=3DEN>THE LORD&#8217;S SHEPHERD=
 </span></h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN>Gain +2 when using <b>INSPIRATION </b>=
to treat
a mental critical injury. </span></p>

<h2><a name=3D"_5gduxjg46yvw"></a><span lang=3DEN>WEALTHY </span></h2>

